          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 22.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ng'ali kalikho kalomekha bali sifwaabi sie bukhobani siibi lukali sili mwinywe, nisio akhaba bakhamanyile Wele bakhanyoolekhanamo tawe. Nabooleelwe bali omundu akonaanga ne maawe omuro! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono munyala mwebonia muriena? Ne kakhali, mukhoyeele mwaba ne bubeeleli, mala omundu okholile sisiindu sie lukano luno arusibwe mu busaangi bwenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne akhaba ne ndi aleeyi nanywe mu mubili, siili busa nanywe mu roho, lundi ndi nga oliyo ne nanywe, mu lisina lio Mwami wefwe Yesu Kristo nabisiisie khale likhalaka khu mundu okholile sisiindu sie chisoni sino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne mwakaanana alala, nga nakaanana nanywe mu mwoyo kwase, ne khulwe bunyali bwo Mwami wefwe Yesu buli alala ne nafwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukhoyeele mwakaanisie omundu yuno khu Sietani onakake kumubili kwewe, nio kumwoyo kwewe kwole khuonisibwa mu Ndaalo yo Mwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
